MACRO                                                                           
WY2000P9. PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
*---  ADJUST TWO DATE FIELDS IN 2-DIGIT YEAR FORMAT                             
*---  SO DATES BETWEEN 1950-2049 COME IN ASCENDING SEQUENCE.                    
                                                                                
     IF TMP1-YY < 50                                                            
       TMP1-YY = TMP1-YY + 50                                                   
     ELSE                                                                       
       TMP1-YY = TMP1-YY - 50                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP2-YY < 50                                                            
       TMP2-YY = TMP2-YY + 50                                                   
     ELSE                                                                       
       TMP2-YY = TMP2-YY - 50                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
